@startuml

title The start message

class "start message" as start_message <<message>> #E1F5FF {
    +workflow type : text
    +tenant : tenant id
    +request payload : text
    +correlation identifier : text
    +instance identifier : text
}

note top of start_message
Opens a run: the caller names the instance and is answered at once.
- workflow type: the definition the run follows.
- tenant: the tenant the run belongs to.
- request payload: what every step builder reads.
- correlation identifier: ties the run to the caller's request.
- instance identifier: makes a repeated start the same run.
end note

@enduml
